# Gabriel Session Plugins Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/session-plugins/FEATURE.md`,
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`, and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/docs/RUNTIME-OPTIMIZATION-HISTORY.md` before changing
  this area.
- Use `session-plugins/FEATURE.md` references to pull adjacent Gabriel docs when
  orchestrator changes cross feature boundaries.
- Current optimization notes: the orchestrator primes the shared per-frame
  person snapshot, and long non-loop animation scheduling lives under this
  session area.
- Update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/session-plugins/FEATURE.md` in the same turn
  whenever behavior, file ownership, load paths, settings, dependencies, or
  optimization assumptions change.
- When `GabrielSessionPlugins.cslist` sources change in ways users discover from
  the tree overview, update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md`.
- If the change crosses into another Gabriel area, update both adjacent docs.
